        <item>
            <title><![CDATA[Anchored Structured Context Compaction]]></title>
            <description><![CDATA[Maintains a typed state block (pinned goal and constraints, verified decisions, an artifact registry, open blockers) and merges only the newly evicted span into it at each compaction, so that long sessions keep exact details instead of drifting]]></description>
            <link>https://agentic-patterns.com/patterns/anchored-structured-context-compaction</link>
            <guid isPermaLink="true">https://agentic-patterns.com/patterns/anchored-structured-context-compaction</guid>
