        <item>
            <title><![CDATA[Debiased LLM-as-a-Judge Evaluation]]></title>
            <description><![CDATA[Removes the systematic distortions of a model judge before its scores gate a release: swaps the order of each pairwise comparison, grades narrow pass/fail rubric items that cite evidence, supplies a reference answer and a judge from another model family, and measures the agreement with human labels first]]></description>
            <link>https://agentic-patterns.com/patterns/debiased-llm-as-a-judge-evaluation</link>
            <guid isPermaLink="true">https://agentic-patterns.com/patterns/debiased-llm-as-a-judge-evaluation</guid>
            <category><![CDATA[Reliability & Eval]]></category>
            <category><![CDATA[llm-as-a-judge]]></category>
            <category><![CDATA[position-bias]]></category>
            <category><![CDATA[verbosity-bias]]></category>
