        <item>
            <title><![CDATA[Hybrid GUI & Visual Grounding]]></title>
            <description><![CDATA[Grounds each GUI action in a filtered accessibility tree first, falls back to numbered visual marks or scaled coordinates only for what the tree cannot see, and confirms the effect of each action from a state diff before the next step]]></description>
            <link>https://agentic-patterns.com/patterns/hybrid-gui-visual-grounding</link>
            <guid isPermaLink="true">https://agentic-patterns.com/patterns/hybrid-gui-visual-grounding</guid>
