        <item>
            <title><![CDATA[LLM Map-Reduce Pattern]]></title>
            <description><![CDATA[Processes each untrusted document in its own sandboxed LLM call with a constrained output, then aggregates the results with deterministic code]]></description>
            <link>https://agentic-patterns.com/patterns/llm-map-reduce-pattern</link>
