        <item>
            <title><![CDATA[Memory Consolidation, Decay & Contradiction Resolution]]></title>
            <description><![CDATA[Gives each stored fact a lifecycle: reconciles each new fact against the related stored facts when it arrives, stamps facts with event time and ingestion time so that a superseded fact is invalidated and not deleted, and runs a background job that merges duplicates and expires spent state]]></description>
            <link>https://agentic-patterns.com/patterns/memory-consolidation-decay-contradiction</link>
            <guid isPermaLink="true">https://agentic-patterns.com/patterns/memory-consolidation-decay-contradiction</guid>
