        <item>
            <title><![CDATA[Trajectory & State-Invariant Evaluation]]></title>
            <description><![CDATA[Grades a tool-using agent on the end state of its sandbox against the expected postconditions and not on its final prose, adds assertions on the recorded tool calls for policy preconditions and forbidden side effects, and repeats each scenario to measure the probability that all trials pass]]></description>
            <link>https://agentic-patterns.com/patterns/trajectory-and-state-invariant-evaluation</link>
            <guid isPermaLink="true">https://agentic-patterns.com/patterns/trajectory-and-state-invariant-evaluation</guid>
